isodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"308521","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"17018","synopsis":"Tsumugi wants to throw a party: a gyoza party! And a party means that she can invite all her friends, everyone she knows at daycare, and Kotori, and Shinobu, and even Yagi! But she's just a little girl, and doesn't know that you have to get permission from Kotori's mom before you can hold a party at Kotori's house. How can Kouhei resolve this sticky situation? And what's the best way to make gyoza, anyway?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pc4858UrmtLZxYQIZduKLNjoOVI.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Tsumugi wants to throw a party: a gyoza party! And a party means that she can invite all her friends, everyone she knows at daycare, and Kotori, and Shinobu, and even Yagi! But she's just a little girl, and doesn't know that you have to get permission from Kotori's mom before you can hold a party at Kotori's house. How can Kouhei resolve this sticky situation? And what's the best way to make gyoza, anyway?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pc4858UrmtLZxYQIZduKLNjoOVI.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11952","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21659","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32828","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"66990","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"308521","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"17021","synopsis":"Oh no! Dad is sick! Tsumugi wants to get him something to make him feel better, and she's willing to brave fierce sharks, dark caves, and giant dogs to make her way to Kotori's house. But what will dad do when he wakes up and finds her gone? And what can Kotori do with this batch of rice she just burnt?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hEohMcxvzqQXcgQFcvyF68gUbcG.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Oh no! Dad is sick! Tsumugi wants to get him something to make him feel better, and she's willing to brave fierce sharks, dark caves, and giant dogs to make her way to Kotori's house. But what will dad do when he wakes up and finds her gone? And what can Kotori do with this batch of rice she just burnt?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hEohMcxvzqQXcgQFcvyF68gUbcG.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11952","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21659","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32828","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"66990","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"308521","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"17027","synopsis":"Kouhei wants to do something nice for his daughter. When his first idea is shot down, he decides to make her one of mommy's old dishes instead. Tsumugi choses squid and taro stew, a dish for grown-ups! Kouhei masters the art of chopping up a squid and peeling a taro, as Tsumugi attains enlightenment by looking into the squid's eyes.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7bgiSkUUr5KJg00QodFV4qO4g5d.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"Kouhei wants to do something nice for his daughter. When his first idea is shot down, he decides to make her one of mommy's old dishes instead. Tsumugi choses squid and taro stew, a dish for grown-ups! Kouhei masters the art of chopping up a squid and peeling a taro, as Tsumugi attains enlightenment by looking into the squid's eyes.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7bgiSkUUr5KJg00QodFV4qO4g5d.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synops